00:23:17.961 --> 00:23:22.264
It's just showing a trajectory
of one cells developing

00:23:22.265 --> 00:23:27.550
trajectory or something, maybe
there is no differentiation.

00:23:27.551 --> 00:23:31.771
For this particular
astrocytoma data sets here,

00:23:31.772 --> 00:23:36.693
most of the cells are in one
